Package: tcl-tnm
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 tcl,
Description: SNMP and MIB Tcl extension from the scotty project
 The Tnm network-management Tcl extension gives Tcl scripts access to SNMP,
 ICMP, DNS, NTP and related protocols, and a MIB compiler/loader for symbolic
 OID handling.
 .
 This package is built from the FlightAware fork of scotty and exists mainly
 to satisfy the "package require Tnm" dependency of the ritz Zino client,
 since Debian no longer ships the historical scotty package. Only the Tcl
 extension itself is shipped, not the standalone scotty interpreter or the
 nmtrapd/nmicmpd daemons.
